      "title": "BAAI/bge-large-en-v1.5 · Hugging Face",
      "url": "https://huggingface.co/BAAI/bge-large-en-v1.5",
      "snippet": "New reranker model: release cross-encoder models BAAI/bge-reranker-base and BAAI/bge-reranker-large, which are more powerful than embedding model. We recommend to use/fine-tune them to re-rank top-k documents returned by embedding models."
