      "snippet": "Recommend switching to newest BAAI/bge-large-en-v1.5, which has more reasonable similarity distribution and same method of usage. FlagEmbedding Model List | FAQ | Usage | Evaluation | Train | Contact | Citation | License More details please refer to our Github: FlagEmbedding. English | 中文 FlagEmbedding can map any text to a low-dimensional dense vector which can be used for tasks like ..."
    },
    {
      "title": "BGE v1 & v1.5 — BGE documentation - bge-model.com",
      "url": "https://bge-model.com/bge/bge_v1_v1.5.html",
      "snippet": "BGE v1 & v1.5 # BGE v1 and v1.5 are series of encoder only models base on BERT. They achieved best performance among the models of the same size at the time of release. BGE # The first group of BGE models was released in Aug 2023. The bge-large-en and bge-large-zh ranked 1st on MTEB and C-MTEB benchmarks at the time released."
    },
    {
      "title": "bge-large-en-v1.5: Text-to-Text model — overview, use cases, alternatives",
      "url": "https://www.aimodels.fyi/models/huggingFace/bge-large-en-v15-baai",
      "snippet": "Overview bge-large-en-v1.5 is a dense retrieval embedding model trained by BAAI for English text that converts documents and queries into fixed-size vector embeddings optimized for semantic search. Built on the sentence-transformers library, this model addresses the similarity distribution problem present in earlier BGE versions—dissimilar sentences no longer produce artificially high ..."
    },
    {
      "title": "bge-large-en-v1.5: Self-Hosting & Deployment Guide",
      "url": "https://llmapi.ai/models/baai-bge-large-en-v1-5/",
      "snippet": "bge-large-en-v1.5 is a large English text embedding model from BAAI&#x27;s BGE (BAAI General Embedding) family that maps text into 1,024-dimensional dense vectors, optimized for semantic search and retrieval."
    }
